6-10-14.\n\nLeft out: #4812 (EV charger bay conflicts, digest 2025-03-10) is Vantorre Mobility. The digests of 2025-07-07, 2025-12-01, 2026-05-03 and 2026-08-03 have no Vantorre Group ticket numbers.\n\nThis is only what's in those three sources. The tickets themselves live in the support system, which I can't see, so check statuses there before the steering committee.","thread_ts":"1792159200.000126"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1792159200.000127","thread_ts":"1792159200.000126"}}
